  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "First, we store the number of rows and columns.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3000,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 90,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we keep the four directions in clockwise order.",
      "start_ms": 3440,
      "end_ms": 7300,
      "start_frame": 103,
      "end_frame": 219,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, down, left, and up.",
      "start_ms": 7920,
      "end_ms": 10880,
      "start_frame": 238,
      "end_frame": 326,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "We also create a visited matrix with the same dimensions as the input.",
      "start_ms": 11560,
      "end_ms": 16300,
      "start_frame": 347,
      "end_frame": 489,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Our row and column start at zero.",
      "start_ms": 16900,
      "end_ms": 19000,
      "start_frame": 507,
      "end_frame": 570,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "And direction zero means right.",
      "start_ms": 19660,
      "end_ms": 21880,
      "start_frame": 590,
      "end_frame": 656,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The loop allows exactly m times n visits, one for every matrix cell.",
      "start_ms": 22360,
      "end_ms": 28820,
      "start_frame": 671,
      "end_frame": 865,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "For the current cell, we add its value to the answer and mark it visited.",
      "start_ms": 29340,
      "end_ms": 34220,
      "start_frame": 880,
      "end_frame": 1027,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Then there is one small but important check.",
      "start_ms": 35020,
      "end_ms": 37340,
      "start_frame": 1051,
      "end_frame": 1120,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "If the answer already contains all m times n values, we stop immediately.",
      "start_ms": 38120,
      "end_ms": 44460,
      "start_frame": 1144,
      "end_frame": 1334,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Why?",
      "start_ms": 45300,
      "end_ms": 45840,
      "start_frame": 1359,
      "end_frame": 1375,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Because after the final valid cell, there is no next unvisited cell to move to.",
      "start_ms": 45920,
      "end_ms": 51900,
      "start_frame": 1378,
      "end_frame": 1557,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Without this check, we would unnecessarily try to calculate another move.",
      "start_ms": 52300,
      "end_ms": 56760,
      "start_frame": 1569,
      "end_frame": 1703,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Otherwise, we calculate the next row and column using the current direction.",
      "start_ms": 57540,
      "end_ms": 63160,
      "start_frame": 1726,
      "end_frame": 1895,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "If that next position is outside the matrix or already visited, we rotate the direction once and calculate the next position again.",
      "start_ms": 64000,
      "end_ms": 74160,
      "start_frame": 1920,
      "end_frame": 2225,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we move there.",
      "start_ms": 74500,
      "end_ms": 75860,
      "start_frame": 2235,
      "end_frame": 2276,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "That is exactly the rule.",
      "start_ms": 76320,
      "end_ms": 77540,
      "start_frame": 2290,
      "end_frame": 2326,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "We just traced.",
      "start_ms": 78040,
      "end_ms": 78800,
      "start_frame": 2341,
      "end_frame": 2364,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Every cell enters the answer once.",
      "start_ms": 79160,
      "end_ms": 81120,
      "start_frame": 2375,
      "end_frame": 2434,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "So the time complexity is O m times n.",
      "start_ms": 81120,
      "end_ms": 85280,
      "start_frame": 2434,
      "end_frame": 2558,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "But the visited matrix also stores m times n states.",
      "start_ms": 85940,
      "end_ms": 89720,
      "start_frame": 2578,
      "end_frame": 2692,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So the auxiliary space is O m times n.",
      "start_ms": 90300,
      "end_ms": 93800,
      "start_frame": 2709,
      "end_frame": 2814,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "The time is already optimal for reading every cell.",
      "start_ms": 94400,
      "end_ms": 97800,
      "start_frame": 2832,
      "end_frame": 2934,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "But now the question is, do we really need this visited matrix?",
      "start_ms": 98420,
      "end_ms": 103120,
      "start_frame": 2953,
      "end_frame": 3094,
      "word_count": 12
    }
  ],
